        "Params": "{3: 'Creeeeak\u2014the door suddenly slams shut behind you the moment you step inside the dim little cottage, plunging the interior into complete darkness. The atmosphere grows eerie.'}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 19,
        "ActionId": 19,
