        "BeginAnim": null,
        "EndAnim": "DialogDisable",
        "BeginDelay": null,
        "EndDelay": null,
        "Params": "{1: '1', 2: '???', 3: \"Well... I'm afraid this humble one doesn't know either. Perhaps that door just now was the Ascendant's doing. How terrifying... O esteemed Gray Raven Commandant, you simply must protect me...\", 4: '1'}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 22,
