        "Params": "{3: 'Snap! With a flick of his fingers, the lights blaze to life, revealing the decorations that were concealed in the dark. Roses surround an intricate stage, and every detail speaks to the care that has been put into this.'}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 48,
        "ActionId": 48,
