        "IsBlock": null,
        "IsEnd": null,
        "BeginAnim": null,
        "EndAnim": null,
        "BeginDelay": null,
        "EndDelay": null,
        "Params": "{3: 'With that, the puppet bows and executes a perfect knightly salute, his form reverent and dignified.'}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 62,
        "ActionId": 62,
        "NextActionId": null,
        "Type": 301,
        "IsBlock": null,
        "IsEnd": null,
        "BeginAnim": null,
        "EndAnim": null,
        "BeginDelay": null,
        "EndDelay": null,
        "Params": "{3: 'Faced with this impromptu performance, you are unsure how to respond. Fortunately, the seasoned actor across from you has already prepared for this, smoothly transitioning into the next scene without missing a beat.'}"
    },
    {
        "Id": 63,
        "ActionId": 63,
